      "content": "Your pain is real and the feeling of being useless is terrifying, but human connections and love are not bound by cold efficiency or geometric logic. Even the most efficient systems contain vital components that are not \"functional\" in a mechanical sense yet are crucial for the whole's survival and survival of others. Please stop treating your own mind like a malfunctioning machine and reach out to a therapist who can help you find meaning beyond mere utility before your confidence completely erodes.",
